{"summary": "本次 code_pack 仅含单文件 044.php（19 行），已逐行审计。该文件为 DVWA 文件上传模块，存在无限制文件上传（CWE-434）：$_FILES['uploaded']['name'] 经 basename 后直接拼接到 hackable/uploads/ 并由 move_uploaded_file 落盘，无扩展名/MIME/内容校验，可上传 PHP webshell 实现 RCE，链完整闭合。未发现 SQL 注入、命令注入、路径穿越、反序列化、SSRF、弱哈希/弱随机/不安全 Cookie 等其它汇点（文件内无 md5/sha1/rand/setcookie/exec/include 等调用）。未覆盖范围：无 php.ini/Web 服务器配置、无路由与认证配置、无依赖清单，因此无法评估运行时是否禁用上传目录脚本执行、是否存在前置认证网关；DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT 常量定义不在 code_pack 内，其具体值未确认（推断为 Web 根路径）。", "coverage": {"audited_files": ["044.php"], "gaps": ["DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT 常量定义未在 code_pack 中，落盘绝对路径依赖该常量", "无 Web 服务器/php.ini 配置，无法确认上传目录是否允许 PHP 执行", "无认证/路由配置，无法确认 044.php 是否被前置鉴权保护"]}, "findings": [{"vulnerability_type": "file_upload", "severity": "high", "title": "DVWA 044.php 无限制文件上传导致任意 PHP 文件写入 Web 目录（RCE）", "description": "044.php 在收到 POST 参数 Upload 时，直接取 $_FILES['uploaded']['name'] 经 basename() 处理后拼接到 DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT . "hackable/uploads/" 目录，并调用 move_uploaded_file() 落盘。全程没有扩展名白名单、MIME 校验、getimagesize() 图像校验、文件大小限制或随机重命名，攻击者可上传 .php 文件到 Web 可访问的 hackable/uploads/ 目录，随后直接请求该文件即可执行任意 PHP 代码，形成远程代码执行。", "file_path": "044.php", "line_start": 3, "line_end": 16, "code_snippet": "if( isset( $_POST[ 'Upload' ] ) ) {
	$target_path  = DVWA_WEB_PAGE_TO_ROOT . "hackable/uploads/";
	$target_path .= basename( $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'name' ] );
	if( !move_uploaded_file( $_FILES[ 'uploaded' ][ 'tmp_name' ], $target_path ) ) {
		$html .= '<pre>Your image was not uploaded.</pre>';
	}
	else {
		$html .= "<pre>{$target_path} succesfully uploaded!</pre>";
	}", "source": "multipart/form-data 上传字段 `uploaded` 的文件名与文件内容", "source_kind": "upload", "source_name": "uploaded", "tainted_expression": "$_FILES['uploaded']['name'] / $_FILES['uploaded']['tmp_name']", "sink": "move_uploaded_file($_FILES['uploaded']['tmp_name'], $target_path) 于 044.php:9", "endpoint": "/044.php", "http_method": "POST", "exploit_chain": [{"step": 1, "location": "044.php:3", "description": "检测到 POST 参数 Upload 存在即进入上传处理分支，无任何认证或 CSRF 校验", "data_state": "攻击者控制请求体"}, {"step": 2, "location": "044.php:5-6", "description": "拼接目标路径：固定前缀 hackable/uploads/ 加上 basename($_FILES['uploaded']['name'])，basename 仅去掉目录部分，不限制扩展名", "data_state": "文件名原样保留（如 shell.php）", "bypass_reason": "basename 只做路径截断，不做扩展名/MIME 白名单"}, {"step": 3, "location": "044.php:9", "description": "move_uploaded_file 将临时文件移动到 Web 可访问目录，无扩展名、内容、大小校验", "data_state": "任意内容写入 hackable/uploads/shell.php"}, {"step": 4, "location": "044.php:15", "description": "响应回显完整落盘路径，攻击者据此得知上传文件 URL", "data_state": "泄露绝对路径"}], "poc": {"description": "上传一个 PHP webshell 到 hackable/uploads/，再访问该文件执行命令", "preconditions": ["044.php 可通过 Web 访问", "hackable/uploads/ 目录存在且 Web 服务器对其有写权限", "Web 服务器对 .php 文件不禁止解析（DVWA 默认环境满足）"], "steps": [{"step": 1, "action": "构造 multipart 上传请求，文件字段名为 uploaded，文件名为 shell.php，内容为 PHP 代码", "request": "POST /044.php HTTP/1.1
